# Catz-Embroidery — local environment (copy to .env.local, fill, never commit)
#
# This suite has no machine paths in its core code paths (a desktop app, not a mod
# loader). The file exists to document the PATTERN: any per-machine value a tool,
# test or fixture resolver needs lives here, read through a single shared reader in
# the workspace — never as a literal in code or committed docs.

# Example — unused today, remove if it stays unused:
# FIXTURES_DIR=C:\path\to\real\embroidery\files
